    <string name="about_text">Drawterm %1$s, for Plan 9 and 9front CPU servers.\n\nTap: button 1. Long press: button 3. Two fingers: button 2, or drag to scroll. While dragging, tap one more finger to cut or two more to paste. Three-finger tap: keyboard. Back: menu.\n\nFiles in the Drawterm folder of the Files app appear as /mnt/term on the server.</string>
